1
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,140
Hi Mum,

2
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:12,520
It’s Day Two and I’m already in love with New York.

3
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:13,980
It’s amazing.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,120
The first day, we were pretty tired from the flight, but we did a bit of sightseeing in the afternoon.

5
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:25,880
We went to see the Statue of Liberty and I wasn’t disappointed.

6
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:30,511
We had a guided tour and learned all about its history.

7
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:33,900
It really is a powerful symbol of peace.

8
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:39,700
Today, we’re going to explore Central Park and Manhattan.

9
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:44,080
In the evening, we’re going to watch the New York Jets.

10
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:46,600
They’re playing at MetLife Stadium.

11
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:51,676
It’s my first game of American football and I’m looking forward to it.

12
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,660
(I think – I’m quite nervous!)

13
00:00:54,700 --> 00:01:00,600
The big concert we’re playing in is tomorrow and we’re all getting quite excited.

14
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:10,080
Just imagine, I’m going to play my trombone in Carnegie Hall, probably the most famous concert hall in the US.

15
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:14,060
Mr Davis is even more excited.

16
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:16,880
He’s going to conduct us in the concert.

17
00:01:17,420 --> 00:01:20,180
He keeps telling us it’s his dream come true.

18
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:23,060
His wife’s going to record the performance.

19
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:30,546
She’s going to send us all the link so you can see the greatest moment of my musical career so far!

20
00:01:31,620 --> 00:01:37,140
There are going to be bands from all over the world, from about 20 different countries.

21
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:38,600
I can’t wait!

22
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:42,133
Hope you’re well and not missing me too much!

23
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,960
Love, Ryan

24
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:46,760
Hi Abigail,

25
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:54,909
Sorry I didn’t write yesterday, but it was such a busy day I just didn’t get the time.

26
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:56,960
We played our second volleyball match of the trip.

27
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:03,000
It was against the under-15 Beijing champions and they won easily.

28
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:06,120
I also hurt my hand quite badly.

29
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:10,360
The sports centre where we played was fantastic.

30
00:02:11,420 --> 00:02:14,838
Really modern and much better than ours back home.

31
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:23,140
Anyway, I’ve got ten minutes to write to you quickly, then I’m going to the bus station to catch a bus to Luanping.

32
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:28,160
I’m so excited because we’re going to visit the Great Wall.

33
00:02:29,060 --> 00:02:35,220
It was probably the one thing I wanted to do most on this trip, after playing volleyball, of course!

34
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:39,800
We’re going to explore the Jinshanling section of the wall.

35
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:44,664
It’s in the mountains and it’s quite a walk to get up to it.

36
00:02:44,664 --> 00:02:46,640
But the views are spectacular.

37
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:49,720
I’m going to take loads of photos.

38
00:02:50,620 --> 00:02:56,843
Luanping is about 130 km away, so we’re going to spend the night there.

39
00:02:57,460 --> 00:03:01,280
Then we’re going back to Beijing for our last day in the city.

40
00:03:02,260 --> 00:03:07,710
Our last match is in the afternoon, but I’m not going to play because of my hand.

41
00:03:08,100 --> 00:03:11,020
I can’t believe the trip is almost over.

42
00:03:11,700 --> 00:03:15,840
China is amazing and the Chinese people are so friendly.

43
00:03:16,660 --> 00:03:17,780
I want to stay longer.

44
00:03:18,682 --> 00:03:20,160
Lots of love, Bettina
